{"seq":3,"slug":"bandits-in-practice","title":"落地与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/multi-armed-bandits-online/practice/bandits-in-practice","wordCount":1770,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"落地与陷阱\">落地与陷阱</h1><p>教科书里的老虎机活在一个干净的世界：奖励即时到达、分布永不改变、单机单线程顺序决策。线上的老虎机活在另一个世界：点击反馈延迟几小时才回流，用户兴趣每周都在漂移，几百个服务实例同时在拉臂和更新。这一篇集中讲那些公式不写、却决定你的老虎机是赚钱还是赔本的工程现实——把前面所有算法从论文搬到生产，真正的难关在这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>落地老虎机要跨过的坑大致归为五类，它们彼此独立又常同时出现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>它破坏了什么假设</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>典型应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟奖励</td>\n<td>奖励即时可见</td>\n<td>基于过时统计决策，探索过度</td>\n<td>批量更新、乐观初始化、占位惩罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非平稳</td>\n<td>分布固定不变</td>\n<td>锁定已过时的旧赢家</td>\n<td>滑动窗口、指数折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励信号设计</td>\n<td>即时奖励对齐长期价值</td>\n<td>标题党、短期最优长期有害</td>\n<td>长期/多目标奖励</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态一致性</td>\n<td>单机顺序更新</td>\n<td>并发更新丢失、统计不一致</td>\n<td>共享存储 + 原子更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估与监控</td>\n<td>能离线复现</td>\n<td>学习中的系统难评估、问题难发现</td>\n<td>离线策略评估、护栏指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[线上老虎机] --&gt; B[延迟奖励:&lt;br/&gt;点击数小时后才回流]&#10;  A --&gt; C[非平稳:&lt;br/&gt;用户兴趣漂移]&#10;  A --&gt; D[奖励设计:&lt;br/&gt;点击≠长期价值]&#10;  A --&gt; E[并发:&lt;br/&gt;多实例同时更新]&#10;  B --&gt; F[决策基于过时统计]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[更新丢失/统计不一致]&#10;  D --&gt; H[标题党等退化]&#10;  F --&gt; I[需工程化兜底]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[线上老虎机] --&gt; B[延迟奖励:&lt;br/&gt;点击数小时后才回流]\n  A --&gt; C[非平稳:&lt;br/&gt;用户兴趣漂移]\n  A --&gt; D[奖励设计:&lt;br/&gt;点击≠长期价值]\n  A --&gt; E[并发:&lt;br/&gt;多实例同时更新]\n  B --&gt; F[决策基于过时统计]\n  C --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[更新丢失/统计不一致]\n  D --&gt; H[标题党等退化]\n  F --&gt; I[需工程化兜底]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"延迟奖励-反馈不会立刻回来\">延迟奖励：反馈不会立刻回来</h2><p>教科书假设拉臂后立刻拿到奖励，现实里反馈往往延迟。用户看到推荐到点击之间可能隔几秒，到「是否转化/留存」的信号可能隔几小时甚至几天。在反馈回流之前，算法看到的是「拉了臂但还没奖励」的悬空状态，若不处理，它会以为这些臂表现差（暂时没奖励），从而过度探索、反复重试同一批臂。</p>\n<p>应对思路有几种。<strong>批量更新</strong>：不每条反馈来就更新，而是按固定窗口（如每分钟）批量结算，承认延迟的存在。<strong>乐观初始化 / 占位</strong>：把尚未回流的拉取暂记为一个中性或乐观值，避免被误判为差臂。对汤普森采样，可以在采样时把「在途未结算」的拉取计入一个临时的不确定性。延迟还会与 <a href=\"../foundations/regret-framework\">遗憾框架</a> 里的遗憾界打折扣——理论上延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 会让遗憾增加约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级，这是必须接受的代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非平稳-昨天的赢家不是今天的赢家\">非平稳：昨天的赢家不是今天的赢家</h2><p>标准老虎机假设每个臂的奖励分布固定，于是它「永不遗忘」地累积所有历史。但线上世界是非平稳的：用户兴趣随季节、热点、生命周期漂移，一个上月的爆款本月可能已经过气。一个累积了全部历史的算法会被陈旧数据拖住，迟迟不肯放弃旧赢家。</p>\n<p>两类标准修正让算法「适当遗忘」。<strong>滑动窗口</strong>：只用最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个观测计算统计量，彻底丢弃更早的历史，对突变式漂移响应快。<strong>指数折扣</strong>：给旧观测乘一个衰减因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma^{\\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0358em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，越老的数据权重越低、平滑遗忘，对渐变式漂移更合适。对应的算法变体有 Discounted-UCB、Sliding-Window-UCB，汤普森采样则对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\alpha,\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做周期性折扣。代价是引入了一个新的权衡：遗忘太快则有效样本变少、估计噪声大，遗忘太慢则跟不上漂移——这个折扣率本身又是一个要调的超参。检测漂移何时发生，可借助 <a href=\"../../time-series-analysis/\">时间序列分析</a> 与 <a href=\"../../anomaly-detection/\">异常检测</a> 的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"奖励信号-你优化什么就得到什么\">奖励信号：你优化什么就得到什么</h2><p>落地里最隐蔽也最致命的坑，不在算法而在<strong>奖励的定义</strong>。老虎机会忠实地最大化你给它的奖励信号——如果信号是即时点击率，它就会无情地把流量推向最能骗到点击的内容，哪怕那是标题党、震惊体、诱导点击。短期指标涨了，用户体验和长期留存却在悄悄崩塌。这不是算法的错，是奖励设错了。</p>\n<p>务实的做法是让奖励对齐真正在乎的长期价值：用完播率而非点击、用次日/七日留存而非单次会话、用加购或复购而非曝光。这些信号往往延迟更久（又回到延迟奖励问题），需要权衡反馈速度与信号质量。当单一指标无法刻画目标时，转向<strong>多目标老虎机</strong>——同时优化点击、时长、多样性等，用标量化（加权和）或帕累托方法平衡，2025 年已有面向推荐的多目标上下文老虎机研究投入实用（如智慧旅游场景）。这也呼应了 <a href=\"bandits-recommendation\">推荐与内容优化</a> 里反复强调的「别让老虎机优化错了东西」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程基建-状态-并发与监控\">工程基建：状态、并发与监控</h2><p>最后是把算法跑成一个可靠服务的基建。<strong>状态持久化与并发</strong>：每个臂的统计量（计数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha/\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_a/b_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）必须在多个服务实例间共享且一致。常见做法是存于 Redis 等低延迟共享存储，并用原子操作（如 Redis 的原子自增、Lua 脚本）更新，否则两个实例同时读-改-写会丢失更新，让统计悄悄失真。高吞吐场景下还要在「每条实时更新」与「批量异步落盘」之间权衡一致性与性能。</p>\n<p><strong>评估与监控</strong>：一个正在学习的系统很难用传统方式评估——你不能简单回放日志，因为日志是被旧策略筛选出来的。需要<strong>离线策略评估</strong>（off-policy evaluation，用重要性加权或反事实方法无偏估计新策略的表现），其思想与 <a href=\"../contextual/adversarial-bandits\">对抗 bandit</a> 的重要性加权同源、与 <a href=\"../../causal-inference/\">因果推断</a> 的去偏工具相通。上线后要监控护栏指标：探索流量占比是否失控、是否有臂被饿死（长期零曝光）、收益相对纯排序基线有没有真的提升、有没有出现异常的流量集中。把老虎机接入正规的 <a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform\">实验平台</a> 做整体效果评估，是负责任上线的最后一道关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>五大落地陷阱：延迟奖励、非平稳、奖励信号设计、状态一致性、评估监控，常同时出现。</li>\n<li>延迟奖励用批量更新、乐观占位应对；理论上延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 让遗憾增约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，须接受。</li>\n<li>非平稳用滑动窗口（突变）或指数折扣（渐变）让算法适当遗忘，折扣率是新的待调权衡。</li>\n<li>奖励信号是最隐蔽的坑：优化即时点击会催生标题党，须对齐长期价值或转多目标老虎机。</li>\n<li>基建：统计量存共享存储 + 原子更新防并发丢失；用离线策略评估 + 护栏指标 + 实验平台监控学习中的系统。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"bandits-vs-ab\">与 AB 测试对比</a>、<a href=\"bandits-recommendation\">推荐与内容优化</a>、<a href=\"../contextual/adversarial-bandits\">对抗 bandit (EXP3)</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform\">AB 测试与统计 · 实验平台</a>、<a href=\"../../time-series-analysis/\">时间序列分析 hub</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"落地与陷阱","id":"落地与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟奖励：反馈不会立刻回来","id":"延迟奖励-反馈不会立刻回来"},{"level":2,"text":"非平稳：昨天的赢家不是今天的赢家","id":"非平稳-昨天的赢家不是今天的赢家"},{"level":2,"text":"奖励信号：你优化什么就得到什么","id":"奖励信号-你优化什么就得到什么"},{"level":2,"text":"工程基建：状态、并发与监控","id":"工程基建-状态-并发与监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐与内容优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/multi-armed-bandits-online/practice/bandits-recommendation"},"next":null}